msgid ""
"\n"
"\n"
"It will also create a new device called @SYMLINK@. It is recommended to use\n"
"@SYMLINK@ instead of @DEVICE@ to avoid problems with changing device names,\n"
"in particular on laptops.\n"
msgstr ""
"\n"
"\n"
"see loob ka uue seade @SYMLINK@. On soovitatav kasutada\n"
"@SYMLINK@ @DEVICE@-asemel vältimaks probleemi seadmete nimede muutmisel,\n"
"eriti sülearvutites.\n"
#
msgid ""
"\n"
"\n"
"On flatpak, this must be done using the manual command instructions below\n"
msgstr ""
"\n"
"\n"
"Flatpak'i kasutades tuleb allpool olevaid käsitsi käsurea juhiseid järgida\n"
#
msgid ""
"\n"
"\n"
"The library will be removed. You might want to reinstall it's\n"
"associated plugin after updating the catalog."
msgstr ""
"\n"
"\n"
"See teek võetakse maha. Sa võid temaga seotud plugina\n"
"taaspaigaldada peale kataloogi uuendamist."
#
msgid ""
"\n"
"\n"
"These libraries will be removed. You might want to reinstall their\n"
"associated plugin after updating the catalog."
msgstr ""
"\n"
"\n"
"Need teegid võetakse maha. Sa võid nendega seotud plugina\n"
"taaspaigaldada peale kataloogi uuendamist."
#
msgid ""
"\n"
"\n"
"These plugins will be uninstalled. You might want to reinstall\n"
"them after updating the catalog.\n"
msgstr ""
"\n"
"\n"
"Need pluginad võetakse maha. Sa võid nad uuesti paigaldada\n"
"peale kataloogi uuendamist.\n"
#
msgid ""
"\n"
"\n"
"This plugin will be uninstalled. You might want to reinstall\n"
"it after updating the catalog.\n"
msgstr ""
"\n"
"\n"
"See plugin võetakse maha. Sa võid ta uuesti paigaldada\n"
"peale kataloogi uuendamist.\n"
#
msgid ""
"\n"
"    Install/uninstall plugin or remove file to mute message"
msgstr ""
"\n"
"    Paigalda/desinstalli plugin või kõrvalda fail teate vaigistamiseks"
#
msgid ""
"\n"
" - your GPS offset from bow must be within your ship's length"
msgstr ""
"\n"
" - su GPS'i nihe vöörist peab olema su laeva pikkuse piires"
#
msgid ""
"\n"
" - your GPS offset from midship must be within your ship's beam"
msgstr ""
"\n"
" - su GPS'i nihe keskosast peab olema su laeva laiuse piires"
#
msgid ""
"\n"
" - your minimum ship icon size must be between 1 and 100 mm"
msgstr ""
"\n"
" - su laeva ikooni vähim suurus peab olema 1 and 100 mm vahel"
#
msgid ""
"\n"
" - your ship's beam must be > 0"
msgstr ""
"\n"
" - te laeva laius peab olema > 0"
#
msgid ""
"\n"
" - your ship's length must be > 0"
msgstr ""
"\n"
" - te laeva pikkus peab olema > 0"
#
msgid ""
"\n"
"An OpenCPN dongle is detected but cannot be used due to missing permissions.\n"
"\n"
"This problem can be fixed by installing a udev rules file. Once installed,\n"
"it will ensure that the dongle permissions are OK.\n"
msgstr ""
"\n"
"OpenCPN'i dongel on tuvastatud, kuid seda ei saa kasutada puuduva loa tõttu.\n"
"\n"
"See probleem on parandatav paigaldades udev-reegli faili. Kord paigaldatud\n"
"garaneerib see, et dongli load on korras.\n"
#
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"\n"
"ITS is distributed in the hope that it will be useful, but WITHOUT ANY "
"WARRANTY; without even the implied warranty of MERCHANTABILITY or FITNESS FOR "
"A PARTICULAR PURPOSE.\n"
"\n"
"See the GNU General Public License for more details.\n"
"\n"
"ITS must only be used in conjunction with approved paper charts and "
"traditional methods of navigation.\n"
"\n"
"DO NOT rely upon OpenCPN for safety of life or property.\n"
"\n"
"Please click \"Agree\" and proceed, or \"Cancel\" to quit.\n"
msgstr ""
"\n"
"OpenCPN'i jagatakse lootuses, et see võib kasulik olla, kuid ILMA MINGI "
"GARANTIITA; isegi mitte kaudse TURUSTAMISE või KONKREETSELE OTSTARBELE "
"SOBIVUSE garantiita.\n"
"\n"
"Vaata GNU General Public License täpsustamiseks.\n"
"\n"
"OpenCPN-i peab kasutama ainult koos heakskiidetud paberkaartidega ja "
"navigatsiooni traditsiooniliste meetoditega.\n"
"\n"
"ÄRA TOETU OpenCPN-ile elu või omandi ohutuse tagamiseks.\n"
"\n"
"Palun vajuta \"Nõus\" nõustumiseks ja jätkamiseks või \"Tühista\" "
"väljumiseks.\n"
#
#, c-format
msgid ""
"\n"
"PlugIn %s, version %i.%i was detected.\n"
"This plugin is obsolete, the o-charts plugin should be used\n"
"instead. Please uninstall this plugin and install o-charts\n"
"using the PlugIn manager master catalog.\n"
msgstr ""
"\n"
"Plugin %s, versioon %i.%i on avastatud.\n"
"See on vana versioon, o-charts pluginat peaks selle\n"
"asemel kasutama. Palun kõrvalda see plugin ja paigalda o-charts'i oma\n"
"kasutades pluginate haldaja peakataloogi.\n"
#
#, c-format
msgid ""
"\n"
"PlugIn %s, version %i.%i was detected.\n"
"This version is known to be unstable and will not be loaded.\n"
"Please update this PlugIn using the PlugIn manager master catalog.\n"
msgstr ""
"\n"
"Plugin %s, versioon %i.%i on avastatud.\n"
"Teadaolevalt on see versioon ebastabiilne ja teda ei käivitata.\n"
"Palun uuenda see plugin kasutades pluginate haldaja peakataloogi.\n"
#
#, c-format
msgid ""
"\n"
"PlugIn %s, version %i.%i was detected.\n"
"This version is known to be unstable.\n"
"Please update this PlugIn using the PlugIn manager master catalog.\n"
msgstr ""
"\n"
"Plugin %s, versioon %i.%i on avastatud.\n"
"Teadaolevalt on see versioon ebastabiilne.\n"
"Palun uuenda see plugin kasutades pluginate haldaja peakataloogi.\n"
#
msgid ""
"\n"
"Rule successfully installed. To activate the new rule restart system or:\n"
"- Exit opencpn.\n"
"- Unplug and re-insert the USB device.\n"
"- Restart opencpn\n"
msgstr ""
"\n"
"Reegli paigaldus õnnestus. Uue reegli aktiveerimiseks taaskäivita süsteem "
"või:\n"
"- Välju OpenCPN'st.\n"
"- Ühendada lahti ja tagasi külge USB-seade.\n"
"- Taaskäivita OpenCPN\n"
#
msgid ""
"\n"
"Rule successfully installed. To activate the new rule restart the system.\n"
msgstr ""
"\n"
"Reegli paigaldus õnnestus. Uue reegli käivitamiseks taaskäivita süsteem.\n"
#
msgid ""
"\n"
"The device @DEVICE@ exists but cannot be used due to missing permissions.\n"
"\n"
"This problem can be fixed by installing a udev rules file. Once installed,\n"
"the rules file will fix the permissions problem.\n"
msgstr ""
"\n"
"Seade @DEVICE@ on olemas, kuid seda pole võimalik kasutada puuduvate õiguste "
"tõttu.\n"
"\n"
"Probleemi saab lahendada udev-reeglifaili paigaldamisega. Kord paigaldatud,\n"
"kõrvaldab reeglifail õiguste probleemi.\n"
#
msgid ""
"\n"
"The device selected is not accessible; opencpn will likely not be able\n"
"to use this device as-is. You might want to exit OpenCPN, reboot and\n"
"retry after creating a file called /etc/udev/rules.d/70-opencpn.rules\n"
"with the following contents:\n"
"\n"
"            KERNEL==\"ttyUSB*\", MODE=\"0666\"\n"
"            KERNEL==\"ttyACM*\", MODE=\"0666\"\n"
"            KERNEL==\"ttyS*\", MODE=\"0666\"\n"
"\n"
"For more info, see the file LINUX_DEVICES.md in the distribution docs.\n"
msgstr ""
"\n"
"Valitud seade ei ole kättesaadav; OpenCPN ilmselt ei suuda\n"
"kasutada seda seadet nagu ta on. Võib olla soovid väljuda OpenCPN, "
"taaskäivitada ja\n"
"proovid pärast faili /etc/udev/rules.d/70-opencpn.rules\n"
"järgeva sisuga:\n"
"\n"
"            KERNEL==\"ttyUSB*\", MODE=\"0666\"\n"
"            KERNEL==\"ttyACM*\", MODE=\"0666\"\n"
"            KERNEL==\"ttyS*\", MODE=\"0666\" loomist uuesti\n"
"\n"
"Lisateabe saamiseks vaata faili LINUX_DEVICES.md levitusdokumentides.\n"
