"appear on the chart. Useful for suppressing shore stations, permanently "
"moored vessels, or duplicate AIS signals that you don't need to monitor."
msgstr ""
"Kui märgitud, selle MMSI AIS-andmeid eiratakse ja laeva ei näidata kaardil. "
